# Git worktrees created inside the repo by agent tooling: a whole second
# checkout, which `git add -A` would otherwise commit. Deliberately narrow —
# the rest of .claude/ (settings, launch config) is shareable project config,
# and a blanket `.claude/` would silently need `git add -f` to commit it.
.claude/worktrees/
